    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5606\"><em data-start=\"5592\" data-end=\"5606\">(18th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5633\"><em data-start=\"5608\" data-end=\"5633\">\u201cCanonically resolved.\u201d</em></p><p data-start=\"5635\" data-end=\"5683\">Once per campaign arc, you may declare an event:</p><blockquote data-start=\"5685\" data-end=\"5712\"><p data-start=\"5687\" data-end=\"5712\"><strong data-start=\"5687\" data-end=\"5712\">Canonically Resolved.</strong></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"5714\" data-end=\"5724\">The event:</p><ul data-start=\"5725\" data-end=\"5874\"><li data-start=\"5725\" data-end=\"5775\"><p data-start=\"5727\" data-end=\"5775\">Cannot generate further cascading consequences</p></li><li data-start=\"5776\" data-end=\"5828\"><p data-start=\"5778\" data-end=\"5828\">Cannot be resurrected, reframed, or re-litigated</p></li><li data-start=\"5829\" data-end=\"5874\"><p data-start=\"5831\" data-end=\"5874\">Cannot be used as leverage in future arcs</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5876\" data-end=\"5943\">You do not undo what happened.<br data-start=\"5906\" data-end=\"5909\" />You end its narrative propagation.</p><h3 data-start=\"5945\" data-end=\"5953\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"5954\" data-end=\"5996\">One use per arc. No Surge required.</p><h3 data-start=\"5998\" data-end=\"6010\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"6011\" data-end=\"6158\">Using this prematurely or to avoid earned fallout may spike Noise dramatically. Canon does not like being sealed before its time.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
